**`aK_row`**: if `tbl e = aKprog2 pM` (`J6AIL4b`, kernel v2), the run `J6Seg.KR.AK.aK2_runs` (`J6AIL5b`) is a
`RowBody6` on `dT = 49` for the table family `q ↦ aKTab2 … (aT q) (rT q) (cT q)`, precondition
